{"candidateAnswer":"A tropical coastal destination in Southeast Asia","evidence":"[D27:1 | 2:18 pm on 12 September, 2023] Jolene: Hey Deb! So sorry for the late reply, been super busy. Last weekend my partner and I traveled to a meditation retreat for a few weeks in Phuket. Amazing experience! Nature, reflection and a break from engineering studies were awesome - it helped me find inner peace.\n[D29:4 | 1:24 pm on 17 September, 2023] Jolene: We tried a scuba diving lesson last Friday and had an awesome time! We found a cool dive spot we can explore together. Trying new things opens up a world of adventure - maybe one day I'll be a certified diver. Anything fun going on with you?","itemId":"urn:uuid:322eefa3-de10-59e6-8eb8-a214dba27580","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f9c31ea1f13c6bced416301435954b000c06ad1987a5872877a34d3ab26f970e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Where did Jolene and her partner find a cool diving spot?","referenceAnswer":"Phuket","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f9c31ea1f13c6bced416301435954b000c06ad1987a5872877a34d3ab26f970e"}}]}